+     | How `M` differs | `reason` | Names |
+     | --- | --- | --- |
+     | The bytes are not a JSON object, or any content follows the object | `frame_not_single_object` | — |
+     | `M` contains a name that is not in the allowed set | `frame_unknown_field` | the first such member, in stream order |
+     | `M` contains an allowed name more than once | `frame_duplicate_field` | the first such member, in stream order |
