+
+     | # | Field | Compared against | On divergence |
+     | --- | --- | --- | --- |
+     | 4a | `schema` | the launcher's own compiled `"agents-infra.pi.shared-runtime.auth.v1"` | `runtime_authorization_mismatch`, `mismatch_field = "schema"` |
+     | 4b | `protocol_version` | the launcher's own compiled version | `runtime_authorization_mismatch`, `mismatch_field = "protocol_version"` |
+     | 4c | `launcher_pid` | `getpid()` | `runtime_authorization_mismatch`, `mismatch_field = "launcher_pid"` |
+     | 4d | `runtime_key` | its own `--runtime-key` | `runtime_authorization_mismatch`, `mismatch_field = "runtime_key"` |
