+  cwd and environment are **not** launcher inputs at all: the broker established
+  both at B9 as process attributes, and `execve` in place preserves them. The
+  launcher includes cwd in the digest it recomputes so that a divergence between
+  the record and the process is detectable, not so that it can set one.
+
+  The frame is not a secret and is not claimed to be one. Same-uid forgery is out
+  of the threat model (section 9); what these gates close is an ad-hoc
+  invocation, a frame naming another process, a plan the durable record does not
