+30b. **The authorization read is bounded because the bound was armed.** Revision
+    5 self-found finding F2. Drive `runtime-launch` with a broker that holds the
+    write end and never writes. It must exit `runtime_launch_unauthorized` with
+    reason `authorization_deadline` within a small multiple of the composed
+    `runtime.startup_timeout_seconds`.
