+a revision-4 broker left running across the upgrade is a broker whose runtime was
+authorized under a launcher gate set that a revision-5 client would otherwise
+assume had been applied. Gate 5 refuses that broker outright with
+`broker_protocol_version_mismatch`, whose remedy is `agents-infra runtime stop` —
+one operator action, after which the assumption is true again. Granting an
+exception on a compatibility argument is precisely the reasoning the rule was
